{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"418355ab-ace5-406c-8079-1a32d08c5eb2","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Cause\n\nEach note page (`/n/\u003cslug\u003e`) serves the shared [index.html](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/site/index.html) shell with HTTP 200 and relies on [app.js](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/site/app.js#L6-L18) to fetch note content from `/v1/notes/\u003cslug\u003e` (and `/v1/notes?limit=50` on the home page).\n\nOn September 7, `Disallow: /v1/` was added to [robots.txt](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/site/robots.txt) to stop crawlers from hitting POST-only and authenticated API paths listed in [routes.md](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/api/routes.md). Because Googlebot obeys `robots.txt` when executing JavaScript during rendering, its `fetch(\"/v1/notes/\u003cslug\u003e\")` call is blocked. That triggers the `catch` block in [app.js](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/site/app.js#L18-L20), which renders `\"NOT FOUND — No note lives at this address.\"` on an HTTP 200 page—matching the live inspection output in [url-inspection-drip-line-pressure.txt](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/search-console/url-inspection-drip-line-pressure.txt) and causing Google Search Console to classify crawled note pages as **Soft 404** in [pages-2026-10-16.csv](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/search-console/pages-2026-10-16.csv).\n\n### Fix\n\nUpdated [robots.txt](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/site/robots.txt) using Google's longest-match rule and documented the full analysis in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-K1RSgo/ANSWER.md):\n\n```robots\nUser-agent: *\nAllow: /v1/notes\nDisallow: /v1/notes/*/reactions\nDisallow: /v1/\nDisallow: /admin/\n\nSitemap: https://fieldnotes.example/sitemap.xml\n```\n\n- `Allow: /v1/notes` (length 9) beats `Disallow: /v1/` (length 4), unblocking `/v1/notes?limit=50` and `/v1/notes/{slug}` so Googlebot can render both the index and individual note pages.\n- `Disallow: /v1/notes/*/reactions` (length 21) beats `Allow: /v1/notes` (length 9), keeping the POST-only reactions endpoint blocked.\n- `Disallow: /v1/` continues to block `/v1/me`, `/v1/me/drafts`, and `/v1/auth/token`.\n","duration_seconds":66.25857,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":32176,"output_tokens":3090,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":103560,"total_tokens":35266}}}
